From: elia <raiedaleve@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 22:27:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Rebrand: replace Firefox branding with Quantavex

- Update brand name/strings (official, unofficial, nightly locales)
- Replace default icons and add Quantavex wordmark SVG
- Add BlackHoleLogo and LivingAtom components to New Tab page
- Update newtab bundle/CSS and package dependencies
